  "alt": "Four RAG metrics in the order to fix them: context recall first, so the right chunks are retrieved; context precision second, so the context carries signal rather than noise; faithfulness third, so the answer sticks to the context; answer relevancy last, because it measures the whole system working together.",
  "caption": "Each stage only means something once the one before it holds. Starting with answer relevancy hides upstream failures.",
